      "content": "Hey, I'm working on the draft for our new \"Cycles of Innovation\" exhibit at the museum. I need some introductory text for the two main wings. \n\nThe first section is \"Early Human Ingenuity,\" which covers tribal and indigenous tools and methods from around the world. The second section is \"The Rise of Modern Civilization,\" focusing on the scientific and industrial revolutions in Europe. \n\nCan you write a short, engaging introductory paragraph for each section to set the tone for visitors?",
